Package: dssatutils
Type: Package
Title: Shared Weather and Soil Download Utilities for DSSAT
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Alwin", "Hopf", email = "alwinhopf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable functions that download weather and soil data from a range of
    public sources (Daymet, GridMET, NASA POWER, Open-Meteo, AgERA5, NASA
    POWER + CHIRPS, DWD station data, E-OBS European grids, BR-DWGD/Xavier Brazil
    grids, CMFD China grids; SSURGO, gNATSGO, iSDAsoil Africa, LUCAS Europe
    topsoil, SoilGrids, SoilGrids 2.0 online, POLARIS, FAO HWSD2) and write
    them as DSSAT .WTH and .SOL files for spatial / gridded crop-model runs.
    Shared by the DSSAT Gridded Run Tutorial and DSSAT ML Phenology Prediction
    projects so the download logic lives in one versioned place.
